# Hover popovers: the agent scope menu and the New ▾ launcher, and leaving them.
hovertext agents
wait 100
snap scope-hover
move 60 20
wait 100
snap scope-left
hovertext ▾ 2
wait 100
snap options-hover
move 60 20
wait 100
snap options-left
hovertext agents
wait 100
key space
snap scope-then-space
hovertext ▾ 2
wait 100
snap scope-then-options
